## Real site reference
The marketing kit follows the live event site (`https://droidknights.dev/2025`, structure expected to carry into 2026). Section order: **Hero → Session → Ticket → Location → Sponsor → QnA → Footer**. Tone/voice examples pulled from it: *"대한민국 최대 안드로이드 개발자들만을 위한 드로이드나이츠"*, *"주니어부터 시니어까지 모두가 공감하고 즐길 수 있는 지식의 장"*. Sponsors use star-tier marks (Platinum/Gold/Silver); tickets are 일반 / 개인후원. Venue reference: 과학기술컨벤션센터(ST Center), 6월 17일.

## Font substitution
All three families (Space Grotesk, Noto Sans KR, Roboto Mono) are the **real** brand fonts and load from **Google Fonts** (`tokens/fonts.css`). No substitutions were made. If you need self-hosted `.woff2` for offline/production use, drop them in and swap the `@import` for `@font-face` rules.
